@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Register

|Customer|
start
:Open register page;
:Fill registration form;
:Submit registration request;
:Validate input data;
if (Email already exists?) then (Yes)
  :Return duplicate email error;
  :Show registration failed message;
else (No)
  :Hash password;
  :Create user in DB;
  if (Insert successful?) then (Yes)
    :Generate token;
    :Return created user and token;
    :Show registration success;
  else (No)
    :Return creation error;
    :Show server error message;
  endif
endif

if (Unexpected server error?) then (Yes)
  :Return exception response;
  :Show fallback error notice;
endif
stop
@enduml
